    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/00e858f6abf087c341e2c8eefc7c676d.avif?t=1720795987\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction:</h2>Explore the <strong>Silicon Sneak</strong> system and use your efforts to rescue your kidnapped sister or uncover the hidden secrets within the system. Your decisions matter and can lead to various endings, but be cautious\u2014the clock is ticking!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/dd3190ee98f53c7e3157cdec504df606.avif?t=1720795987\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Use the terminal and your phone to make progress. Discover for yourself how to navigate each path. Utilize mechanisms to earn money, make improvements, but always be careful\u2014people are watching you.<br><br>In each playthrough, create your strategy and achieve the 6 possible endings. Your only limitation in reaching these endings is time, so act swiftly\u2014you won\u2019t be able to save everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/2fdd608838bab52c4363cd820b45a5c2.avif?t=1720795987\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art Style:</h2>With unique pixel art, Rapta is entirely created using only 2 colors: a base color for illustration and a highlight color for important points. Customize the colors and make the system visually appealing to your taste.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/00e858f6abf087c341e2c8eefc7c676d.avif?t=1720795987\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction:</h2>Explore the <strong>Silicon Sneak</strong> system and use your efforts to rescue your kidnapped sister or uncover the hidden secrets within the system. Your decisions matter and can lead to various endings, but be cautious\u2014the clock is ticking!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/dd3190ee98f53c7e3157cdec504df606.avif?t=1720795987\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Use the terminal and your phone to make progress. Discover for yourself how to navigate each path. Utilize mechanisms to earn money, make improvements, but always be careful\u2014people are watching you.<br><br>In each playthrough, create your strategy and achieve the 6 possible endings. Your only limitation in reaching these endings is time, so act swiftly\u2014you won\u2019t be able to save everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944670/extras/2fdd608838bab52c4363cd820b45a5c2.avif?t=1720795987\" width=600 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art Style:</h2>With unique pixel art, Rapta is entirely created using only 2 colors: a base color for illustration and a highlight color for important points. Customize the colors and make the system visually appealing to your taste.",
    "short_description": "Navigate through Silicon Sneak, where time is of the essence to save your sister. Choose to be an Ethical Hacker or one among those who hide from the police. With various minigames to challenge your dexterity, evolve with upgrades and make decisions to discover multiple endings.",
